 * Converts standard scientific note names into matching mp3 filenames.
 * e.g., "C#4" becomes "Cs4.mp3".
 * @param {string[]} notes - Array of note identifiers
 * @returns {Object.<string, string>} Mapping of note names to asset URLs
 */
